<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Propane marketers downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Propane marketers downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded AmeriGas Partners LP, Ferrellgas Partners LP and Suburban Propane Partners LP to outperform from buy, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- AmeriGas ended Wednesday at 24-3/8, Ferrellgas at 23, and Suburban Propane at 19-3/4.</p>
</text>
